WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.146
Zoom! The Rocket Girl clone shot toward Roxy.

2
00:00:09.147 --> 00:00:11.319
Roxy leaped out of the way.

3
00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:14.074
She fired her eye laser beams at the clone.

4
00:00:14.075 --> 00:00:15.877
Whiz-hoo!

5
00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:20.598
The clone jumped, but it was too slow.

6
00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:23.500
Its foot smoked where the laser had hit it.

7
00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:26.684
The clone glanced at its foot and then flew away.

8
00:00:26.685 --> 00:00:29.256
Roxy shot after it.

9
00:00:29.257 --> 00:00:32.399
Roxy's friends were at the lake in Metro City Park.

10
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.286
Mara and Jack were looking at a turtle.

11
00:00:35.287 --> 00:00:37.038
Terrell looked up.

12
00:00:37.039 --> 00:00:40.813
Zoom! The Rocket Girl clone flew past.

13
00:00:40.814 --> 00:00:47.322
Zoom! Roxy flew past, shooting lasers at the clone.

14
00:00:47.323 --> 00:00:52.094
"Whoa! Two Rocket Girls!" cried Terrell.

15
00:00:52.095 --> 00:00:56.851
Mara and Jack looked up. "Where?" asked Mara.

16
00:00:56.852 --> 00:00:59.772
"They're gone now," said Terrell.

17
00:00:59.773 --> 00:01:05.840
Jack and Mara both gave Terrell a funny look.

18
00:01:05.841 --> 00:01:09.634
The Professor Ditto clones were arguing and yelling in the lab.

19
00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:13.663
"It's not my fault Rocket Girl escaped!" said one.

20
00:01:13.664 --> 00:01:18.060
"It was your idea to lock her in that room!" said another.

21
00:01:18.061 --> 00:01:20.143
"I wanted to lock her in the—"

22
00:01:20.144 --> 00:01:23.577
Ka-boom! The wall blew apart.

23
00:01:23.578 --> 00:01:26.961
The Rocket Girl clone crashed onto the floor.

24
00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:30.230
Roxy flew in after it.

25
00:01:30.231 --> 00:01:33.967
The Professor Dittos looked at the broken Rocket Girl clone.

26
00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:35.773
They looked at Roxy.

27
00:01:35.774 --> 00:01:38.730
"Get her!" yelled one.

28
00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.171
The professors rushed toward Roxy.

29
00:01:41.172 --> 00:01:45.768
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's lasers hit one professor.

30
00:01:45.769 --> 00:01:48.137
Smoke came from his ears.

31
00:01:48.138 --> 00:01:52.621
"Which one of you is the real Professor Ditto?" yelled Roxy.

32
00:01:52.622 --> 00:01:58.180
The professors all answered. "I am."

33
00:01:58.181 --> 00:02:02.057
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired again.

34
00:02:02.058 --> 00:02:04.454
The professors jumped out of the way.

35
00:02:04.455 --> 00:02:09.924
Roxy's lasers hit the computer. Boom!

36
00:02:09.925 --> 00:02:15.811
Fzzt! Fzzt! All the clones sparked and smoked.

37
00:02:15.812 --> 00:02:18.021
"Oh . . . ," said Roxy.

38
00:02:18.022 --> 00:02:21.756
"Without the computer, the clones are breaking down!

39
00:02:21.757 --> 00:02:25.630
Soon I'll find out which one is the real Professor Ditto."

40
00:02:25.631 --> 00:02:29.872
One by one, the clones fell over until none were standing.

41
00:02:29.873 --> 00:02:31.983
Roxy was shocked.

42
00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:36.570
"Where's the real Professor Ditto?"

43
00:02:36.571 --> 00:02:39.689
A month later the new playground was finished.

44
00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:50.035
At the opening ceremony, Roxy looked at the crowd and gasped.

45
00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:56.548
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "That's—"

46
00:02:56.549 --> 00:03:00.226
"The real Professor Ditto," said the mayor.

47
00:03:00.227 --> 00:03:04.300
"He retired from Metro City University ten years ago.

48
00:03:04.301 --> 00:03:08.210
He felt bad that the clones he invented were causing trouble.

49
00:03:08.211 --> 00:03:12.309
So he donated money to help build the new playground."

50
00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:16.287
"This playground is awesome!" said Jack.

51
00:03:16.288 --> 00:03:21.133
"I wonder if the two Rocket Girls helped to build it," said Terrell.

52
00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:26.430
Mara laughed. "There's only one Rocket Girl."

53
00:03:26.431 --> 00:03:30.487
"I saw two!" said Terrell, looking annoyed.

54
00:03:30.488 --> 00:03:39.642
Roxy smiled. "I believe you, Terrell."

